  `"<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd"><html dir="ltr" lang="en"><head><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://di867tnz6fwga.cloudfront.net/brand-kits/071ab0be-ee67-4945-8807-29ecacfa97bc/primary/96729a74-5ced-4b21-bcc3-74e7d921cc03.png"/><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting"/><title>arolariu.ro | Welcome</title><meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting" content="true"/><meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no,address=no,email=no,date=no,url=no"/></head><body style="background-color:#f8f9fa;margin:0;padding:0"><!--$--><!--html--><!--head--><div style="display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0" data-skip-in-text="true">Welcome to arolariu.ro, Test User! Let&#x27;s get started.<div> ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿</div></div><!--body--><table border="0" width="100%" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" align="center"><tbody><tr><td style="background-color:#f8f9fa;margin:0;padding:32px 0;font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:37.5em;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e9ecef;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;width:600px"><tbody><tr style="width:100%"><td><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#1124cb;padding:18px 24px;text-align:center"><tbody><tr><td><img alt="arolariu.ro" src="https://di867tnz6fwga.cloudfront.net/brand-kits/071ab0be-ee67-4945-8807-29ecacfa97bc/primary/96729a74-5ced-4b21-bcc3-74e7d921cc03.png" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none;margin:0 auto;width:140px;height:auto;max-width:100%"/><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);margin:10px 0 0;margin-top:10px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">Practical tools. Clean insights. Built for everyday spending.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding:28px 32px"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:12px;display:inline-block;border:1px solid #e9ecef;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 10px;color:#666666;background-color:#f8f9fa;margin:0 0 12px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0">Welcome</p><p style="font-size:24px;line-height:30px;margin:0 0 14px;font-weight:700;color:#0b0b0c;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">Welcome to arolariu.ro</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 14px;color:#0b0b0c;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">Hi Test User,</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 14px;color:#0b0b0c;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">Thanks for joining arolariu.ro. We&#x27;re glad you&#x27;re here. Our platform helps you turn everyday receipts into organized financial insights — powered by AI analysis.</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#f8f9fa;border:1px solid #e9ecef;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin:0 0 14px"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700;color:#0b0b0c;font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin-left:0">How it works</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#0b0b0c;font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">• <!-- -->Upload — snap a photo or upload a PDF of any receipt</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#0b0b0c;font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">• <!-- -->Analyze — our AI extracts items, prices, merchants, and even suggests recipes from grocery receipts</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#0b0b0c;font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">• <!-- -->Track — view spending dashboards by merchant, category, month, or year</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#f8f9fa;border:1px solid #e9ecef;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin:0 0 14px"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700;color:#0b0b0c;font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:10px;margin-left:0">What you can do</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#0b0b0c;font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">• <!-- -->Get allergen alerts on food products</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#0b0b0c;font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">• <!-- -->Share invoices with family members or colleagues</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#0b0b0c;font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">• <!-- -->Export statistics and spending reports</p><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#0b0b0c;font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">• <!-- -->Access your data from any device</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 14px;color:#0b0b0c;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">Ready to get started? Upload your first receipt and watch the magic happen. The whole process takes less than a minute.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0 0 14px;color:#0b0b0c;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">Questions or feedback? We&#x27;d love to hear from you at <a href="mailto:admin@arolariu.ro" style="color:#b404ff;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">admin@arolariu.ro</a>.</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;margin:0;color:#0b0b0c;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">Cheers,<br/>The arolariu.ro Team</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="text-align:center;padding:8px 0 4px"><tbody><tr><td><a href="https://arolariu.ro/domains/invoices/upload-scans" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration-line:none;display:inline-block;background-color:#b404ff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 18px;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700" target="_blank">Upload your first receipt</a><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;margin:12px 0 0;color:#666666;margin-top:12px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">If the button doesn&#x27;t work, open this link:<!-- --> <a href="https://arolariu.ro/domains/invoices/upload-scans" style="color:#b404ff;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">https://arolariu.ro/domains/invoices/upload-scans</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;margin:12px 0 0;color:#666666;margin-top:12px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">Or:<!-- --> <a href="https://arolariu.ro/domains/invoices/view-invoices" style="color:#b404ff;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">Explore the dashboard</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-color:#e9ecef;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin:0"/><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="padding:18px 32px 22px;text-align:center"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#666666;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0"><a href="https://arolariu.ro" style="color:#b404ff;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">arolariu.ro</a></p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#666666;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">Bucharest, Romania<!-- --> •<!-- --> <a href="mailto:admin@arolariu.ro" style="color:#b404ff;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration:none" target="_blank">admin@arolariu.ro</a></p><p style="font-size:11px;line-height:16px;margin:0;color:#666666;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">© 2022-2026 arolariu.ro. All rights reserved.</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>"`;

